  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mOV5RKV.png\" alt=\"横幅\" width=\"572\" height=\"110\"></p><p>本模组允许玩家重置村民交易。在村民交易界面中添加了重置按钮，可用于刷新交易选项。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>注意：只能重置尚未获得经验的村民交易。若村民已有交易历史获得经验值，则重置按钮不会显示！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>在服务器游玩时，此模组必须同时在服务端安装！</strong></span></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz合作伙伴\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要服务器？使用优惠码\"mrbysco\"可享首月八折</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如有疑问欢迎加入我的Discord社区。</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord链接\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;<strong>想支持我们？</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon赞助\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon赞助\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -ShyNieke</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
